WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.245 --> 00:00:34.027
[Instrumental music playing]

00:00:34.068 --> 00:00:39.312
Ah

00:00:52.093 --> 00:01:04.931
To the list of things
that make me sad,

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:12.458
I add each day 
each day

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:18.401
The color goes.

00:01:18.962 --> 00:01:23.975
 This is the world:

00:01:23.975 --> 00:01:30.274
Just gray and gray
and gray.

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:45.648
Longing is the same in both directions.

00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:52.915
Look at the sky

00:01:52.915 --> 00:01:57.269
and remember

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:01.891
Everything beautiful

00:02:01.891 --> 00:02:07.728
lies both forwards and backwards. 

00:02:07.735 --> 00:02:13.518
Look at the sky
and remember.

00:02:13.518 --> 00:02:18.010
That it’s good to be alive.

00:02:21.675 --> 00:02:26.343
Ah ah ah

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:46.156
Overwriting the written constellations

00:02:46.156 --> 00:02:53.220
I create my own new map

00:02:55.594 --> 00:03:01.212
I trace my finger

00:03:02.603 --> 00:03:09.587
along the lines.

00:03:14.362 --> 00:03:19.423
I am the little blade of light

00:03:19.423 --> 00:03:21.909
Blade of light

00:03:21.909 --> 00:03:27.886
from the crack in the door.

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:37.858
I am the orange wedge

00:03:37.858 --> 00:03:42.347
Of sun
Of sun

00:03:42.347 --> 00:03:48.747
Through your window.

00:04:02.674 --> 00:04:08.239
This is the beginning

00:04:08.239 --> 00:04:14.459
of the story we tell
again and again

00:04:14.459 --> 00:04:18.158
It is the beginning

00:04:18.158 --> 00:04:25.044
Who will listen?
of the story we tell

00:04:36.502 --> 00:04:43.569
We are fragile
we are precious

00:04:43.569 --> 00:04:48.391
we are fragile

00:04:48.391 --> 00:04:54.619
We are fragile
we are precious

00:04:54.619 --> 00:04:59.512
we are fragile

